The Law of Sines states:
\[ \frac{BC}{\sin(\angle BAC)} = \frac{AC}{\sin(\angle ABC)} \]
\[ \frac{BC}{\sin(57^\circ)} = \frac{3000}{\sin(56^\circ)} \]

