\[
h(x) = \frac{7}{2} \sin\left(\frac{1}{2}x + \frac{3\pi}{2}\right) - \frac{1}{2}
\]

Thus, the exact expression for \( h(x) \) is:
\[
\boxed{\frac{7}{2} \sin\left(\frac{1}{2}x + \frac{3\pi}{2}\right) - \frac{1}{2}}
\]
