   \[
   \text{Total area of the bases} = 2 \times 42 = 84 \text{ cm}^2
   \]

2. **Calculate the area of the four rectangular lateral faces:**
   - The first rectangular face has dimensions \( 18 \text{ cm} \times 5 \text{ cm} \):
     \[
     \text{Area} = 18 \times 5 = 90 \text{ cm}^2
     \]
