   \[
   \text{Total area of the lateral faces} = 90 + 50 + 40 + 40 = 220 \text{ cm}^2
   \]

3. **Calculate the total surface area:**
   \[
   \text{Total surface area} = \text{Total area of the bases} + \text{Total area of the lateral faces}
   \]
   \[
   \text{Total surface area} = 84 + 220 = 304 \text{ cm}^2
   \]

