   \]

7. The ratio of the area of the small shaded ring to the area of the large shaded ring is:
   \[
   \text{Ratio} = \frac{A_{\text{small ring}}}{A_{\text{large ring}}} = \frac{3\pi}{7\pi} = \frac{3}{7}
   \]

Therefore, the correct answer is \(\boxed{D}\).

Answer: \boxed{D}
